This product includes software developed by third parties. The full license
text of every dependency is published with each release as a separate download
(`third-party-notices.tar.gz` on the release page), together with a
one-line-per-dependency index. They are deliberately not inside the binary
archive: GoReleaser builds that archive from files committed to this
repository, and a path that only exists on the release runner would match
nothing there - which fails the release rather than quietly shipping less. This
file records the attribution that the Apache-2.0 dependencies require, plus the
direct dependency set as a whole.

